   "type": "text",
   "id": "ka_eps_t",
   "x": 1862,
   "y": 232,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 147,
   "text": "POST /public → ABE public key, log key\nPOST /keygen → a user's ABE key\n      HMAC(KA_SECRET) valid? ts within 60 s?\n      break-glass needs a 15+ char reason\nPOST /publish_head → signed tree head\n      only if it extends the last head\nPOST /heads → every signed head",
   "originalText": "POST /public → ABE public key, log key\nPOST /keygen → a user's ABE key\n      HMAC(KA_SECRET) valid? ts within 60 s?\n      break-glass needs a 15+ char reason\nPOST /publish_head → signed tree head\n      only if it extends the last head\nPOST /heads → every signed head",
